(2867964, 401306, 48890, '<td valign="top">There are many droplets in the water images in this challenge, but this is the only one I like.  Actually, can''t quite understand why. :) 8</td>', 'There are many droplets in the water images in this challenge, but this is the only one I like.  Actually, can''t quite understand why. :) 8', '2006-09-27 02:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2867971, 400803, 61318, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a bit more of her face...without it there''s a certain lack of emotion which I think you might have been looking for...still, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'I''d like to see a bit more of her face...without it there''s a certain lack of emotion which I think you might have been looking for...still, it''s a nice shot.', '2006-09-27 02:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2867983, 402244, 66222, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures, and the steely cold metal contrasts nicely against the warm lights reflected in the pools and droplets of water.  Good choice of subject matter for this category, as it definitely captures the "feeling" of rain.</td>', 'Interesting textures, and the steely cold metal contrasts nicely against the warm lights reflected in the pools and droplets of water.  Good choice of subject matter for this category, as it definitely captures the "feeling" of rain.', '2006-09-27 02:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2867995, 401728, 61818, '<td valign="top">As I vote this a ten, I hope the girl just has perfect skin tones for black and white and that you haven''t been using dodge on her face.  Good luck, it is a great shot.</td>', 'As I vote this a ten, I hope the girl just has perfect skin tones for black and white and that you haven''t been using dodge on her face.  Good luck, it is a great shot.', '2006-09-27 02:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2868013, 401644, 61818, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  A photo that shows rain in a rain challenge.  Amazing.  Plus it''s a nice composition to boot.  Good luck. 8.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  A photo that shows rain in a rain challenge.  Amazing.  Plus it''s a nice composition to boot.  Good luck. 8.', '2006-09-27 02:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2868029, 401752, 61318, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you did to this, but it looks weird...the halos around the trees are much too intense, and there''s some brush stroke-like action going on in the sky.  I suspect you tried to lighten an otherwise very dark shot, but the PP here ends up being counter-productive.</td>', 'I don''t know what you did to this, but it looks weird...the halos around the trees are much too intense, and there''s some brush stroke-like action going on in the sky.  I suspect you tried to lighten an otherwise very dark shot, but the PP here ends up being counter-productive.', '2006-09-27 02:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2868044, 401787, 66222, '<td valign="top">This has a surreal quality to it that''s interesting.</td>', 'This has a surreal quality to it that''s interesting.', '2006-09-27 02:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2868090, 402167, 45475, '<td valign="top">Good enough for me, and it''s a great image.</td>', 'Good enough for me, and it''s a great image.', '2006-09-27 02:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2868107, 400805, 66222, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, and a nice feeling of rain that appeals to the senses.</td>', 'Interesting composition, and a nice feeling of rain that appeals to the senses.', '2006-09-27 02:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2868156, 401738, 25355, '<td valign="top">This had such huge potential; it''s a real shame about the blurriness of the background, probably caused by a slight panning action on the cyclists. But I guess you were constrained by the available light. ;-) Also, a touch oversharpened. But definitely a good rainy day shot.</td>', 'This had such huge potential; it''s a real shame about the blurriness of the background, probably caused by a slight panning action on the cyclists. But I guess you were constrained by the available light. ;-) Also, a touch oversharpened. But definitely a good rainy day shot.', '2006-09-27 03:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2868187, 402252, 46601, '<td valign="top">great idea well executed</td>', 'great idea well executed', '2006-09-27 03:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
