(2869315, 402246, 61234, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Although ''bad weather'' doesn''t constitute ''rain'' I still have to give this huge points for vision. I would love to be standing there now.</td>', 'Great shot!  Although ''bad weather'' doesn''t constitute ''rain'' I still have to give this huge points for vision. I would love to be standing there now.', '2006-09-27 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869317, 402252, 3102, '<td valign="top">Oh.  Man.  Who else could have shot this?  I think there should just be an automated script that gives Scalvert a 10 on each challenge.  That would save me all this extra effort each time :)</td>', 'Oh.  Man.  Who else could have shot this?  I think there should just be an automated script that gives Scalvert a 10 on each challenge.  That would save me all this extra effort each time :)', '2006-09-27 13:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
