(2869349, 402212, 3102, '<td valign="top">Dang, that dude looks familiar!  :)  Even though it doesn''t actually show rain, this is one of my two 10s this time around.  I really like the sharpness of SJ, and the blur of the umbrella.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Dang, that dude looks familiar!  :)  Even though it doesn''t actually show rain, this is one of my two 10s this time around.  I really like the sharpness of SJ, and the blur of the umbrella.  Very nicely done!', '2006-09-27 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869386, 399604, 50695, '<td valign="top">where are the balloons? ;) Nice abstract quality. In fact, you might want to think about cropping out the sky, because the line between mountain and sky is different than all the other lines and breaks the pattern.</td>', 'where are the balloons? ;) Nice abstract quality. In fact, you might want to think about cropping out the sky, because the line between mountain and sky is different than all the other lines and breaks the pattern.', '2006-09-27 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
