(2869459, 401791, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and I like the contrast between the crisp feel in the top half with the grainy feel at the bottom</td>', 'Great DOF and I like the contrast between the crisp feel in the top half with the grainy feel at the bottom', '2006-09-27 14:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
