(2869466, 399754, 47541, '<td valign="top">A simple concept that has been executed well.  Good choice of a simple subject behind the window.  I''m not sure the border works though?</td>', 'A simple concept that has been executed well.  Good choice of a simple subject behind the window.  I''m not sure the border works though?', '2006-09-27 14:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
