(2869474, 401320, 47541, '<td valign="top">While the lines in the grate are prominent they dont quite distract from the leaf.  A very nice shot but the water going down the drain is alsmot lost without the title drawing attention to it.</td>', 'While the lines in the grate are prominent they dont quite distract from the leaf.  A very nice shot but the water going down the drain is alsmot lost without the title drawing attention to it.', '2006-09-27 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869480, 402252, 47541, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I almost moved on thinking "average" until I looked twice and noticed the rain from under the umbrella - what a great idea!  it''s a shame that the right-hand side seems to be unbalanced with regard to the amount of water shown</td>', 'Very nice!  I almost moved on thinking "average" until I looked twice and noticed the rain from under the umbrella - what a great idea!  it''s a shame that the right-hand side seems to be unbalanced with regard to the amount of water shown', '2006-09-27 14:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869482, 402150, 47541, '<td valign="top">While I dont think the title works the picture is very good.  Lovely contrast in colours and the way the light fades towards the back keeps my focus squarely on the caterpillar</td>', 'While I dont think the title works the picture is very good.  Lovely contrast in colours and the way the light fades towards the back keeps my focus squarely on the caterpillar', '2006-09-27 14:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869484, 400568, 47541, '<td valign="top">For an impage lacking in "wow" from colours this works very well.  The drop is nice and simple and the background is interesting but not distracting.</td>', 'For an impage lacking in "wow" from colours this works very well.  The drop is nice and simple and the background is interesting but not distracting.', '2006-09-27 14:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869487, 400613, 47541, '<td valign="top">A great grainy feel gives this an "art-house movie" feel and the colours are fantastic!</td>', 'A great grainy feel gives this an "art-house movie" feel and the colours are fantastic!', '2006-09-27 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869488, 399867, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The capture of the reflections is very good - it must have been a still night.  I think the slanted horizon actually works in this shot.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The capture of the reflections is very good - it must have been a still night.  I think the slanted horizon actually works in this shot.', '2006-09-27 15:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869491, 399881, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good simple subject matter that doesnt distract from the excellent capture of the water flowing from on leaf to another.  The only negative is the bright reflection in the water near the top - very nice overall!</td>', 'Good simple subject matter that doesnt distract from the excellent capture of the water flowing from on leaf to another.  The only negative is the bright reflection in the water near the top - very nice overall!', '2006-09-27 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869493, 399430, 47541, '<td valign="top">This gets better every time I look at it!  I love the change in texture between the top and bottom of the image and the symmetry of the leaves!</td>', 'This gets better every time I look at it!  I love the change in texture between the top and bottom of the image and the symmetry of the leaves!', '2006-09-27 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869495, 401309, 47541, '<td valign="top">I dont get the title.  That doesnt however mean I like the image any less.  Nice simple shot that draws attention to the water on the leaf very well.</td>', 'I dont get the title.  That doesnt however mean I like the image any less.  Nice simple shot that draws attention to the water on the leaf very well.', '2006-09-27 15:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
