(2869506, 401790, 47541, '<td valign="top">While at first look the shot has an "ordinary" feel to it, the water where the girl has jumped and the anticipation that she brings to the shot makes this very good overall.</td>', 'While at first look the shot has an "ordinary" feel to it, the water where the girl has jumped and the anticipation that she brings to the shot makes this very good overall.', '2006-09-27 15:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
