(2869515, 401850, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this was a bit of a chance shot as ideally the plane would be "in" the rainbow more.  This is a nice shot that is only really spoilt by the noise</td>', 'I''m guessing this was a bit of a chance shot as ideally the plane would be "in" the rainbow more.  This is a nice shot that is only really spoilt by the noise', '2006-09-27 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
