(2869523, 400327, 47541, '<td valign="top">In thumbnail this looked like a 10.  Now I see it larger the cat is a little too blurred for my liking and the border does not work.  Still a 7 though and the eyes in the cat come through the water nicely</td>', 'In thumbnail this looked like a 10.  Now I see it larger the cat is a little too blurred for my liking and the border does not work.  Still a 7 though and the eyes in the cat come through the water nicely', '2006-09-27 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
