(2869538, 402217, 47541, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice scene with great colours but doesnt saw "wow" to me - I think the centered composition is the problem</td>', 'It''s a nice scene with great colours but doesnt saw "wow" to me - I think the centered composition is the problem', '2006-09-27 15:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
