(2869590, 401924, 47541, '<td valign="top">The overall composition of the objects is good but the title implies the kids are the main feature but they are dwarfed by the pagoda</td>', 'The overall composition of the objects is good but the title implies the kids are the main feature but they are dwarfed by the pagoda', '2006-09-27 15:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869591, 399032, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette</td>', 'Nice silhouette', '2006-09-27 15:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869592, 401800, 47541, '<td valign="top">I like the way the girl with the umbrella is facing away from everyone eles - it seems she is asking ''is it over'' not just to the rain but also to the sightseeing :)</td>', 'I like the way the girl with the umbrella is facing away from everyone eles - it seems she is asking ''is it over'' not just to the rain but also to the sightseeing :)', '2006-09-27 15:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869594, 400230, 47541, '<td valign="top">A larger DOF would have been better as the toys at the top seem a little too OOF to me</td>', 'A larger DOF would have been better as the toys at the top seem a little too OOF to me', '2006-09-27 15:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869595, 402239, 47541, '<td valign="top">This is quite a nice shot if you cover up the windowledge (or whatever) - a different crop would have been better</td>', 'This is quite a nice shot if you cover up the windowledge (or whatever) - a different crop would have been better', '2006-09-27 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869597, 401837, 47541, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there is nothing "wow" about this image :(</td>', 'Unfortunately there is nothing "wow" about this image :(', '2006-09-27 15:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869599, 401386, 47541, '<td valign="top">roofless and rainless!  I''d prefer to see more of the walls as they look interesting compared to the sky</td>', 'roofless and rainless!  I''d prefer to see more of the walls as they look interesting compared to the sky', '2006-09-27 15:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869601, 402170, 47541, '<td valign="top">This image is very busy and that means I dont know what to focus on, let alone find time to find the rain</td>', 'This image is very busy and that means I dont know what to focus on, let alone find time to find the rain', '2006-09-27 15:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869603, 400566, 47541, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great image but the glare and the very bright lights spoil it a bit</td>', 'This could have been a great image but the glare and the very bright lights spoil it a bit', '2006-09-27 15:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869605, 398783, 47541, '<td valign="top">For an image that lacks much in it this works well.  The long exposure time on the rain adds a lot of interest</td>', 'For an image that lacks much in it this works well.  The long exposure time on the rain adds a lot of interest', '2006-09-27 15:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869607, 400751, 47541, '<td valign="top">This could almost be called "abstract rain" - works well</td>', 'This could almost be called "abstract rain" - works well', '2006-09-27 15:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869609, 401659, 47541, '<td valign="top">Lacks a main interest point</td>', 'Lacks a main interest point', '2006-09-27 15:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869612, 402199, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good idea and I think more of the slide would have been even better</td>', 'A good idea and I think more of the slide would have been even better', '2006-09-27 15:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869617, 400240, 47541, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this shot</td>', 'I love the colours in this shot', '2006-09-27 15:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869619, 402096, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but the edges seem a little "edited" - from resizing perhaps?</td>', 'Nice colours but the edges seem a little "edited" - from resizing perhaps?', '2006-09-27 15:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869623, 402031, 47541, '<td valign="top">A great idea that would have benfitted from a tigher crop to include just the persons reflection of the "red thing" but both in the frame means I''m not sure where I''m supposed to look</td>', 'A great idea that would have benfitted from a tigher crop to include just the persons reflection of the "red thing" but both in the frame means I''m not sure where I''m supposed to look', '2006-09-27 15:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869624, 400121, 38032, '<td valign="top">Love it - POV, comp, the drops look great .. and the name is great for a dog!</td>', 'Love it - POV, comp, the drops look great .. and the name is great for a dog!', '2006-09-27 15:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869625, 402082, 47541, '<td valign="top">Very nice but nothing seems to be in focus to draw my attention</td>', 'Very nice but nothing seems to be in focus to draw my attention', '2006-09-27 15:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869626, 401753, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice colours</td>', 'Nice colours', '2006-09-27 15:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869627, 402244, 811, '<td valign="top">I love simple shots like this.  The shallow depth of field really works for me to add interest.  The *drab* colors help to reinforce the theme of rain, and sets a tone or mood for the shot.</td>', 'I love simple shots like this.  The shallow depth of field really works for me to add interest.  The *drab* colors help to reinforce the theme of rain, and sets a tone or mood for the shot.', '2006-09-27 15:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869628, 401787, 47541, '<td valign="top">A very nice simple shot of drops</td>', 'A very nice simple shot of drops', '2006-09-27 15:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869629, 401308, 47541, '<td valign="top">To be honmest its the colours in the umbrealla that make this a good shot.</td>', 'To be honmest its the colours in the umbrealla that make this a good shot.', '2006-09-27 15:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869630, 400784, 47541, '<td valign="top">great timing</td>', 'great timing', '2006-09-27 15:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869631, 399156, 47541, '<td valign="top">I like the way the reflections show the colours in the umbrella that are not obvious when we look at the umbrealla - great idea</td>', 'I like the way the reflections show the colours in the umbrella that are not obvious when we look at the umbrealla - great idea', '2006-09-27 15:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869632, 401796, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s so sharp that he looks like he''s made of marble or metal. this is an interesting effect but doesn''t enhance the sense of rain or of "internal climate" 6</td>', 'it''s so sharp that he looks like he''s made of marble or metal. this is an interesting effect but doesn''t enhance the sense of rain or of "internal climate" 6', '2006-09-27 15:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869633, 401925, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great timing</td>', 'Great timing', '2006-09-27 15:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869636, 402167, 47541, '<td valign="top">Lacks a bit of pizazz - perhaps if the view was closer to the ground and ran the eye up one of the ridges?</td>', 'Lacks a bit of pizazz - perhaps if the view was closer to the ground and ran the eye up one of the ridges?', '2006-09-27 15:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869638, 401683, 47541, '<td valign="top">A nice "drugged out" effect - by zooming during shot?</td>', 'A nice "drugged out" effect - by zooming during shot?', '2006-09-27 15:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869643, 401284, 47541, '<td valign="top">This shot has an element of the drama required but doesnt say to me "oh scary storm coming" if you know what I mean - the patch of blue sky doesn''t help that either :)</td>', 'This shot has an element of the drama required but doesnt say to me "oh scary storm coming" if you know what I mean - the patch of blue sky doesn''t help that either :)', '2006-09-27 15:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869644, 400786, 47541, '<td valign="top">A street sign underwater - cute!</td>', 'A street sign underwater - cute!', '2006-09-27 15:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869646, 402212, 47541, '<td valign="top">While I really dont think this meets the challenge I love the effect you got here - great idea so heres a 6</td>', 'While I really dont think this meets the challenge I love the effect you got here - great idea so heres a 6', '2006-09-27 15:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869648, 400874, 47541, '<td valign="top">Id like to see more road and less dashboard</td>', 'Id like to see more road and less dashboard', '2006-09-27 15:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869706, 402212, 62095, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.. Bit of a stretch on the theme I think, though.</td>', 'Interesting image.. Bit of a stretch on the theme I think, though.', '2006-09-27 16:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869712, 399719, 62095, '<td valign="top">I find the object in the foreground is a bit distracting in this photo.</td>', 'I find the object in the foreground is a bit distracting in this photo.', '2006-09-27 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869713, 400805, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this, rather than your execution - I''m not sure how you might make it more impactful, but a couple of things stand out for me immediately:  your depth of field is very shallow, such that the candles are not particularly in focus, along with the rainy window. Also there''s a lack of a feel of contrast - you''ve exposed well enough for the light of the candles themselves, but the light beyond that is rather flat and uninteresting - perhaps simply waiting until the day outside were a little darker might have done it.</td>', 'I like the idea of this, rather than your execution - I''m not sure how you might make it more impactful, but a couple of things stand out for me immediately:  your depth of field is very shallow, such that the candles are not particularly in focus, along with the rainy window. Also there''s a lack of a feel of contrast - you''ve exposed well enough for the light of the candles themselves, but the light beyond that is rather flat and uninteresting - perhaps simply waiting until the day outside were a little darker might have done it.', '2006-09-27 16:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869720, 400695, 6999, '<td valign="top">Your title hints most strongly at that bird being your point of interest, but it''s quite a long way down the list of the things one forst sees when looking at this image - after the skeleton of that boat, the people, the buildings in the background. The light is quite enjoyable, but there seems really to be one band of complex overlapping things, and then the quiet light of the rest of the image.</td>', 'Your title hints most strongly at that bird being your point of interest, but it''s quite a long way down the list of the things one forst sees when looking at this image - after the skeleton of that boat, the people, the buildings in the background. The light is quite enjoyable, but there seems really to be one band of complex overlapping things, and then the quiet light of the rest of the image.', '2006-09-27 16:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869725, 402031, 61863, '<td valign="top">Perhaps even better without the jeans and shoes i.e. all reflections?</td>', 'Perhaps even better without the jeans and shoes i.e. all reflections?', '2006-09-27 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869728, 401800, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the solitary umberella wielder is also facing the opposite way from his fellows, though compositionally it''s a great pity that the man behind him is by far the most eye-catchingly dressed, making it tricky to isolate the little chap visually. had this been my shot, I''m not certain I''d have entered it - or I might have done, expecting no great result - I think that''s mostly because of the confusion of impacts around the umberella man: the darkness of him, the creeping of the shape of the umberella into the shape of the hillside, the massive pull to image left of the gaze of the other guys, all make it a conscious effort to keep one''s eyes on that sole individual, and weaken the ipact of the image. You get points though for black and white, and for having I think pushed yourself towards at least an interesting idea.</td>', 'I like the fact that the solitary umberella wielder is also facing the opposite way from his fellows, though compositionally it''s a great pity that the man behind him is by far the most eye-catchingly dressed, making it tricky to isolate the little chap visually. had this been my shot, I''m not certain I''d have entered it - or I might have done, expecting no great result - I think that''s mostly because of the confusion of impacts around the umberella man: the darkness of him, the creeping of the shape of the umberella into the shape of the hillside, the massive pull to image left of the gaze of the other guys, all make it a conscious effort to keep one''s eyes on that sole individual, and weaken the ipact of the image. You get points though for black and white, and for having I think pushed yourself towards at least an interesting idea.', '2006-09-27 16:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869737, 402131, 6999, '<td valign="top">Streetlight? I guess we must take your word for it, though I see nothing at all here to suggest such a thing. The detailing in the hands is nice, but the light on them is terribly flat, almost completely even and leaving a very two-dimensional impression. One gets a certain feeling of the kind of thing you might have been aiming for, but for me it absolutely lacks drama.</td>', 'Streetlight? I guess we must take your word for it, though I see nothing at all here to suggest such a thing. The detailing in the hands is nice, but the light on them is terribly flat, almost completely even and leaving a very two-dimensional impression. One gets a certain feeling of the kind of thing you might have been aiming for, but for me it absolutely lacks drama.', '2006-09-27 16:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869742, 401728, 6999, '<td valign="top">Kind of fun portrait; nice to see some more black and white getting around the place, but beyond simple portraiture I don''t find mich here - and, in a challenge sense, the rain element seems almost like an incidental. It would be mean to mark you down for that though, but I''ve never really understood what''s so interesting about portraiture ...</td>', 'Kind of fun portrait; nice to see some more black and white getting around the place, but beyond simple portraiture I don''t find mich here - and, in a challenge sense, the rain element seems almost like an incidental. It would be mean to mark you down for that though, but I''ve never really understood what''s so interesting about portraiture ...', '2006-09-27 16:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869753, 402109, 52854, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo -</td>', 'Very nice photo -', '2006-09-27 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869758, 398674, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice photo -</td>', 'Nice photo -', '2006-09-27 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869760, 401271, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice photo -</td>', 'Nice photo -', '2006-09-27 16:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869766, 402167, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has suggestions of a slightly careless approach - the number of weeds visible, that little section of sky, the lack of a sense of conclusion to the linear compositional elements. Keeping a shot whose primary impact is textural in colour like this doesn''t work I think - this would be so much more impactful in black and white, and even more so had it been shot at a less harsh time of light.</td>', 'Has suggestions of a slightly careless approach - the number of weeds visible, that little section of sky, the lack of a sense of conclusion to the linear compositional elements. Keeping a shot whose primary impact is textural in colour like this doesn''t work I think - this would be so much more impactful in black and white, and even more so had it been shot at a less harsh time of light.', '2006-09-27 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869773, 402161, 66114, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Cool shot.  More depth means more in focus.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Cool shot.  More depth means more in focus.', '2006-09-27 16:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869776, 401790, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great shot - nice color. The white pole atop the little girl''s head makes it carosel like.</td>', 'Great shot - nice color. The white pole atop the little girl''s head makes it carosel like.', '2006-09-27 16:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869779, 399156, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great shot - Nice color.</td>', 'Great shot - Nice color.', '2006-09-27 16:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869780, 401420, 52854, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo -</td>', 'Really nice photo -', '2006-09-27 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869781, 402252, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great photo - Perfect title!</td>', 'Great photo - Perfect title!', '2006-09-27 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869785, 401873, 52854, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo -</td>', 'Very nice photo -', '2006-09-27 16:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
