(2869811, 401320, 53278, '<td valign="top">when i look at this picture i feel the fall coming,8</td>', 'when i look at this picture i feel the fall coming,8', '2006-09-27 16:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869813, 402109, 53278, '<td valign="top">i think this shot could have done well in purple challenge too,8</td>', 'i think this shot could have done well in purple challenge too,8', '2006-09-27 16:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869817, 401644, 53278, '<td valign="top">exactly the topic, but i think the image is lacking a main subject.5</td>', 'exactly the topic, but i think the image is lacking a main subject.5', '2006-09-27 16:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869818, 401830, 55908, '<td valign="top">A sense of rain definitely embodies this image. I really like it, I just wish the drops hanging from each leaf were more prominent. Nice capture though! 8o)</td>', 'A sense of rain definitely embodies this image. I really like it, I just wish the drops hanging from each leaf were more prominent. Nice capture though! 8o)', '2006-09-27 16:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869819, 399879, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! Nice use of shallow dof! The beads feel so tangible!</td>', 'This is beautiful! Nice use of shallow dof! The beads feel so tangible!', '2006-09-27 16:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869820, 398677, 53278, '<td valign="top">gloomy mood</td>', 'gloomy mood', '2006-09-27 16:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869821, 401728, 53278, '<td valign="top">Singing in the rainnnnn!</td>', 'Singing in the rainnnnn!', '2006-09-27 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869822, 401478, 55908, '<td valign="top">Aww makes me miss the coast! I loved driving by the beach on those stormy days and this photo captures the mood quite well! Feels like there could be a little more sharpness throughout the depth, but great image nonetheless! 8o)</td>', 'Aww makes me miss the coast! I loved driving by the beach on those stormy days and this photo captures the mood quite well! Feels like there could be a little more sharpness throughout the depth, but great image nonetheless! 8o)', '2006-09-27 16:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869823, 402150, 53278, '<td valign="top">great colors!</td>', 'great colors!', '2006-09-27 16:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869826, 400604, 53278, '<td valign="top">great close up, good for Zen phtography to</td>', 'great close up, good for Zen phtography to', '2006-09-27 16:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869827, 402096, 53278, '<td valign="top">very nice shot , and great bokeh</td>', 'very nice shot , and great bokeh', '2006-09-27 16:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869830, 399867, 53278, '<td valign="top">sears towers,chicago! nice shot,7</td>', 'sears towers,chicago! nice shot,7', '2006-09-27 16:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869831, 400092, 53278, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot,8</td>', 'Very nice shot,8', '2006-09-27 16:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869835, 400568, 53278, '<td valign="top">i think the background pulls you away from the dropplet of water</td>', 'i think the background pulls you away from the dropplet of water', '2006-09-27 17:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869837, 401336, 55908, '<td valign="top">Another wonderful use of shallow dof!</td>', 'Another wonderful use of shallow dof!', '2006-09-27 17:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869840, 401784, 50695, '<td valign="top">severe foreshortening revitalizes this cliche. Not sure I like the crop, though. The band of black at the top seems boring. I bet you could crop some of it off.</td>', 'severe foreshortening revitalizes this cliche. Not sure I like the crop, though. The band of black at the top seems boring. I bet you could crop some of it off.', '2006-09-27 17:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869843, 402131, 50695, '<td valign="top">great title.</td>', 'great title.', '2006-09-27 17:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869845, 400673, 55908, '<td valign="top">And by the looks lof the nice blue sky, you''ll be waiting for awhile ;o) Great interpretation of a challenge with which nature didn''t cooperate in your neck of the woods. The bare feet work for me! If I might suggest, it would have been great to taken the scene to the beach! Nice shot though. 8o)</td>', 'And by the looks lof the nice blue sky, you''ll be waiting for awhile ;o) Great interpretation of a challenge with which nature didn''t cooperate in your neck of the woods. The bare feet work for me! If I might suggest, it would have been great to taken the scene to the beach! Nice shot though. 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869850, 401320, 55908, '<td valign="top">Yay fall is here! Lovely image of an aspect most will walk right by without appreciating it''s beauty. Really like it! 8o)</td>', 'Yay fall is here! Lovely image of an aspect most will walk right by without appreciating it''s beauty. Really like it! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869855, 401796, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle and unique feel to this! I think it works well in the challenge and is quite compelling. The plant in the lower right might be slightly distracting from the main subject, but nothing to pick on. Great shot! 8o)</td>', 'Very nice angle and unique feel to this! I think it works well in the challenge and is quite compelling. The plant in the lower right might be slightly distracting from the main subject, but nothing to pick on. Great shot! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869860, 402092, 55908, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! This works perfectly and I really love the natural colors! That drop on the tip is so subtle but such an essential touch! Wonderly crafted image. One of my favorites! 8o)</td>', 'Beautiful! This works perfectly and I really love the natural colors! That drop on the tip is so subtle but such an essential touch! Wonderly crafted image. One of my favorites! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869864, 401312, 55908, '<td valign="top">Beautifully vibrant red! I wish the drops were a little more prominent, but the point still gets across. Good job! 8o)</td>', 'Beautifully vibrant red! I wish the drops were a little more prominent, but the point still gets across. Good job! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869870, 401925, 55908, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea and wonderfully captured! It''s almost perfect but seems like it may have benefitted from a slightly fast shutter speed? Maybe it''s just me, but I love the shot anyways! 8o)</td>', 'Fantastic idea and wonderfully captured! It''s almost perfect but seems like it may have benefitted from a slightly fast shutter speed? Maybe it''s just me, but I love the shot anyways! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869871, 401198, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is another wonderful image of a beautiful aspect of life that so often goes unnoticed by normal passers-by. Lovely idea and fantastic capture! The monotone is perfect! 8o)</td>', 'This is another wonderful image of a beautiful aspect of life that so often goes unnoticed by normal passers-by. Lovely idea and fantastic capture! The monotone is perfect! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869872, 401790, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the pole coming out of her head, the way her shirt is puffed up and I can barely tell that she''s off the ground. But what a great little girl! 6</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the pole coming out of her head, the way her shirt is puffed up and I can barely tell that she''s off the ground. But what a great little girl! 6', '2006-09-27 17:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869874, 400079, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great idea! You might have tried for a bit more depth, I didn''t quite catch the rode right away but the idea comes across still. Good job 8o)</td>', 'Great idea! You might have tried for a bit more depth, I didn''t quite catch the rode right away but the idea comes across still. Good job 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869877, 402131, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The hands are a wonderful subject and provide a nice simplicity that is quite compelling! I think keeping color subdued was a good idea too! Nice shot! 8o)</td>', 'Very nice! The hands are a wonderful subject and provide a nice simplicity that is quite compelling! I think keeping color subdued was a good idea too! Nice shot! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869881, 400804, 50695, '<td valign="top">don''t wet outside!</td>', 'don''t wet outside!', '2006-09-27 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869883, 400763, 55908, '<td valign="top">Nice image! Feels like it could be a bit sharper throughout though. You might have even excluded the foreground and most of the grass and focused just on the ripple and a few blades of grass. Just a thought, but I like where you were going with this! 8o)</td>', 'Nice image! Feels like it could be a bit sharper throughout though. You might have even excluded the foreground and most of the grass and focused just on the ripple and a few blades of grass. Just a thought, but I like where you were going with this! 8o)', '2006-09-27 17:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2869900, 401791, 60173, '<td valign="top">Part of me wants to flip that image so the drips are going up..</td>', 'Part of me wants to flip that image so the drips are going up..', '2006-09-27 17:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
