(2870200, 400712, 41554, '<td valign="top">Love this. The DOF, the subject, the clarity, the tones. Great job controling exposure. Great shot. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Love this. The DOF, the subject, the clarity, the tones. Great job controling exposure. Great shot. One of my favorites.', '2006-09-27 19:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870205, 400140, 41554, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I cannot perceive rain in this shot. It may be there, it just isn''t evident enough. The bottom right is blown and there is a lot of noise (rain?) on the whole right side.</td>', 'Sorry, I cannot perceive rain in this shot. It may be there, it just isn''t evident enough. The bottom right is blown and there is a lot of noise (rain?) on the whole right side.', '2006-09-27 19:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870207, 401897, 50695, '<td valign="top">two people sandwiched by darkness, who are themselves darkness. eaves and umbrellas and windshields reflect the light of what is possible, but not happening. Notice a large triangle of lighter tones, bisected by the horizon. Just below the horizon, i.e., completely of this world of wet, appear our shadowy protagonists and their shadowy reflections. It is as if the rain itself created them. And there... I think I see God in a milk truck... 8</td>', 'two people sandwiched by darkness, who are themselves darkness. eaves and umbrellas and windshields reflect the light of what is possible, but not happening. Notice a large triangle of lighter tones, bisected by the horizon. Just below the horizon, i.e., completely of this world of wet, appear our shadowy protagonists and their shadowy reflections. It is as if the rain itself created them. And there... I think I see God in a milk truck... 8', '2006-09-27 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870210, 401850, 50695, '<td valign="top">such big things made so small. you are magic. 8</td>', 'such big things made so small. you are magic. 8', '2006-09-27 19:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870213, 402239, 41554, '<td valign="top">Had you been able to capture more detail of the building, this would make a very nice shot (maybe with another crop). As it is, it has nice tones and the droplets are sharp and nice to look at. The building is too centered for my taste.</td>', 'Had you been able to capture more detail of the building, this would make a very nice shot (maybe with another crop). As it is, it has nice tones and the droplets are sharp and nice to look at. The building is too centered for my taste.', '2006-09-27 19:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870217, 400662, 41554, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks almost like a ghost rider... Usually I don''t like too much soft focus, but here it serves the purpose really well, making the pic look "damp" and wet. It works as it is, but I think you might have cropped a bit tighter on the right (about half an inch). Good shot.</td>', 'Wow, looks almost like a ghost rider... Usually I don''t like too much soft focus, but here it serves the purpose really well, making the pic look "damp" and wet. It works as it is, but I think you might have cropped a bit tighter on the right (about half an inch). Good shot.', '2006-09-27 19:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
