(2870255, 401683, 55908, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot! This takes the cake for me! I do love all the wonderful green leaves with water dropletts images, but this is unique, fun, fresh! I love it!! Excellent idea and phenomonally captured!! 8o)</td>', 'Brilliant shot! This takes the cake for me! I do love all the wonderful green leaves with water dropletts images, but this is unique, fun, fresh! I love it!! Excellent idea and phenomonally captured!! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870257, 400720, 45924, '<td valign="top">It looks untouchable. I like it.</td>', 'It looks untouchable. I like it.', '2006-09-27 19:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870258, 399867, 41554, '<td valign="top">Very very good. If it had actually been raining it would be stunning.</td>', 'Very very good. If it had actually been raining it would be stunning.', '2006-09-27 19:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870260, 402096, 45924, '<td valign="top">Your border is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Your border is a bit distracting.', '2006-09-27 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870262, 399879, 45924, '<td valign="top">Your border distracts.</td>', 'Your border distracts.', '2006-09-27 19:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870263, 400568, 45924, '<td valign="top">I like how you caught it falling.</td>', 'I like how you caught it falling.', '2006-09-27 19:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870264, 401644, 41554, '<td valign="top">Not bad, real rain... Looks a bit blurry, did you shoot this handheld with IS, perhaps?</td>', 'Not bad, real rain... Looks a bit blurry, did you shoot this handheld with IS, perhaps?', '2006-09-27 19:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870268, 402096, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wow! What impeccalbe timing! Brilliantly captured! Another favorite of mine! I love that you chose to go with sillohetted foliage for a unique taste! The tiny drop breaking free is just phenomenalputs the whole image over the top! Definitely a blue ribbon contender. 8o)</td>', 'Wow! What impeccalbe timing! Brilliantly captured! Another favorite of mine! I love that you chose to go with sillohetted foliage for a unique taste! The tiny drop breaking free is just phenomenalputs the whole image over the top! Definitely a blue ribbon contender. 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870269, 401608, 55908, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, just lost the focus a bit. Maybe a smaller aperture next time to get everything in focus? 8o)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, just lost the focus a bit. Maybe a smaller aperture next time to get everything in focus? 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870271, 400720, 41554, '<td valign="top">Very minimalistic... I think it would work better if shot closer or cropped tighter. As is, there are (for me) too many points in the pic to be able to rest the eye.</td>', 'Very minimalistic... I think it would work better if shot closer or cropped tighter. As is, there are (for me) too many points in the pic to be able to rest the eye.', '2006-09-27 19:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870273, 400230, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely and unique image, very well composed with a bit of a story to keep the attention. Wonderful shot! 8o)</td>', 'This is a lovely and unique image, very well composed with a bit of a story to keep the attention. Wonderful shot! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870274, 400604, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice use of thirds and DOF. The cool reflections on the drop make me wish for a closer shot of it...</td>', 'Nice use of thirds and DOF. The cool reflections on the drop make me wish for a closer shot of it...', '2006-09-27 19:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870280, 400874, 41554, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, sorry, looks like a snapshot to me. Blown, blurred, and the dashboard and its reflections are totally distraction. Sorry, not a winner.</td>', 'Mmmm, sorry, looks like a snapshot to me. Blown, blurred, and the dashboard and its reflections are totally distraction. Sorry, not a winner.', '2006-09-27 19:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870281, 402252, 55908, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea! I was thinking something similar but never got around to trying it. I like that you use a younger subject, I think it works quite well for the playful mood. I question your choice of background, though your excellent lighting keeps the focus on your main subject. Nice job! 8o)</td>', 'Fantastic idea! I was thinking something similar but never got around to trying it. I like that you use a younger subject, I think it works quite well for the playful mood. I question your choice of background, though your excellent lighting keeps the focus on your main subject. Nice job! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870283, 402038, 55908, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the movement in this image and am glad you chose to expose it the way you did! A very clever twist on a common image! The lighting works wonderfully too! Great job! 8o)</td>', 'I absolutely love the movement in this image and am glad you chose to expose it the way you did! A very clever twist on a common image! The lighting works wonderfully too! Great job! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870286, 400803, 41554, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea. This shot would really work for me if the model''s expression was more clearly visible - as it is, there is just a hint of her annoyance. I also find the vase outside a bit distracting, I think this would be better without it.</td>', 'A very nice idea. This shot would really work for me if the model''s expression was more clearly visible - as it is, there is just a hint of her annoyance. I also find the vase outside a bit distracting, I think this would be better without it.', '2006-09-27 19:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870287, 399604, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully subtle yet very moody! Great shot! 8o)</td>', 'Wonderfully subtle yet very moody! Great shot! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870289, 401850, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a bit noisy perhaps. Did you try NeatImage or similar? Anyway, great catch.</td>', 'Nice shot, a bit noisy perhaps. Did you try NeatImage or similar? Anyway, great catch.', '2006-09-27 19:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870290, 401850, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Seems noisy? Lovely image though! 8o)</td>', 'Very nice! Seems noisy? Lovely image though! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870291, 400804, 55908, '<td valign="top">Clever! Nice shot. 8o)</td>', 'Clever! Nice shot. 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870295, 401837, 55908, '<td valign="top">Those bubbles are great and really give the image a lot of character. Beautiful leaf, though the photo feels a bit flat, maybe more contrast? But I still like it! 8o)</td>', 'Those bubbles are great and really give the image a lot of character. Beautiful leaf, though the photo feels a bit flat, maybe more contrast? But I still like it! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870296, 402218, 41554, '<td valign="top">Not bad, I probably would crop out most of the ground, to make the viewer focus on the sky (and the probability of rain). I think I know what you tried to go for, that is, showing the dry land waiting for the rain, but I think that cool looking sky needed a bit more "space" in the pic.</td>', 'Not bad, I probably would crop out most of the ground, to make the viewer focus on the sky (and the probability of rain). I think I know what you tried to go for, that is, showing the dry land waiting for the rain, but I think that cool looking sky needed a bit more "space" in the pic.', '2006-09-27 19:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870297, 398674, 55908, '<td valign="top">Aside from the title''s unfortunate accuracy, you''ve really captured it well! Just beautiful! 8o) -8</td>', 'Aside from the title''s unfortunate accuracy, you''ve really captured it well! Just beautiful! 8o) -8', '2006-09-27 19:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870298, 402082, 41554, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp. Also, I find the composition (with coming and going lines and the leaf proeminent at the top) a bit unbalanced.</td>', 'Not very sharp. Also, I find the composition (with coming and going lines and the leaf proeminent at the top) a bit unbalanced.', '2006-09-27 19:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870305, 400784, 55908, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and nice timing! Very abstract and I love itit''s unique! 8o)</td>', 'Cool shot and nice timing! Very abstract and I love itit''s unique! 8o)', '2006-09-27 19:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870307, 400106, 55908, '<td valign="top">I had to laugh! I think you''ve got some issues if you don''t laugh when you see this! I hope this one gets top three at least because it will brighten anyone''s day!!! Amazaing and going into my favorites! 10 10 10! 8o)</td>', 'I had to laugh! I think you''ve got some issues if you don''t laugh when you see this! I hope this one gets top three at least because it will brighten anyone''s day!!! Amazaing and going into my favorites! 10 10 10! 8o)', '2006-09-27 20:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870309, 400805, 63588, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this better if the left candle were in focus. And if I could see the base of the candlesticks/window sill. 6</td>', 'I think I would like this better if the left candle were in focus. And if I could see the base of the candlesticks/window sill. 6', '2006-09-27 20:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870315, 402231, 55908, '<td valign="top">I took me a second to see it, but beautiful! 8o)</td>', 'I took me a second to see it, but beautiful! 8o)', '2006-09-27 20:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870318, 400127, 63588, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel the rain.</td>', 'Makes me feel the rain.', '2006-09-27 20:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870321, 401196, 55908, '<td valign="top">Huh? I hate to critique on titles, but it confused me.</td>', 'Huh? I hate to critique on titles, but it confused me.', '2006-09-27 20:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
