(2871708, 399430, 61191, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!. Love the use of DOF, colors, constrast and the details here.</td>', 'Amazing shot!. Love the use of DOF, colors, constrast and the details here.', '2006-09-28 07:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871710, 401738, 57886, '<td valign="top">Good picture (which could be even better IMHO if you would have pictured only one of the guys :o)</td>', 'Good picture (which could be even better IMHO if you would have pictured only one of the guys :o)', '2006-09-28 07:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871713, 400786, 57886, '<td valign="top">OMG, a lot of rain :o) Nice picture.</td>', 'OMG, a lot of rain :o) Nice picture.', '2006-09-28 07:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871714, 402082, 61191, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Would be a great shot if the drop was sharp.</td>', 'Good composition. Would be a great shot if the drop was sharp.', '2006-09-28 07:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871715, 401420, 57886, '<td valign="top">Sweet :o) Would have loved to see more of her face though, but I like the colors and how visible the "rain" is - good luck :o)</td>', 'Sweet :o) Would have loved to see more of her face though, but I like the colors and how visible the "rain" is - good luck :o)', '2006-09-28 07:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871718, 398674, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.. would have been great to see the spider too :o)</td>', 'Nicely done.. would have been great to see the spider too :o)', '2006-09-28 07:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871719, 399604, 61191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Would benefit from noise reduction!</td>', 'Nice shot. Would benefit from noise reduction!', '2006-09-28 07:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871720, 401149, 47541, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the "drops on a plant" theme.  This adds a unique feel as its not the leaves that we are drawn to but the much more interesting part of the plant. well done.</td>', 'An interesting take on the "drops on a plant" theme.  This adds a unique feel as its not the leaves that we are drawn to but the much more interesting part of the plant. well done.', '2006-09-28 07:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871721, 402046, 57886, '<td valign="top">Cute. Maby a little blue, but nice anyway :o)</td>', 'Cute. Maby a little blue, but nice anyway :o)', '2006-09-28 07:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871722, 401309, 61191, '<td valign="top">Well executed. Your composition is great.</td>', 'Well executed. Your composition is great.', '2006-09-28 07:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871725, 399395, 47541, '<td valign="top">A great idea but I find the hand overpowers the leaf and thus the rain.  I do like the lighting on the hand though as it gives it quite a mysterious feel.</td>', 'A great idea but I find the hand overpowers the leaf and thus the rain.  I do like the lighting on the hand though as it gives it quite a mysterious feel.', '2006-09-28 07:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871728, 400146, 47541, '<td valign="top">A fantastically simple idea which works very well.  The rings intersecting gives us something interesting to look at as our eye moves around the image</td>', 'A fantastically simple idea which works very well.  The rings intersecting gives us something interesting to look at as our eye moves around the image', '2006-09-28 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871731, 401643, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good idea that has been executed well.  The main problem for me is that the wooden beam is too interesting and I dont really focus on the raindrops at all.</td>', 'A good idea that has been executed well.  The main problem for me is that the wooden beam is too interesting and I dont really focus on the raindrops at all.', '2006-09-28 07:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871732, 402252, 61191, '<td valign="top">Wow, something different here! I love your idea, very creative. Lighting is superb. Best shot so far, well done!</td>', 'Wow, something different here! I love your idea, very creative. Lighting is superb. Best shot so far, well done!', '2006-09-28 07:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871735, 399604, 47541, '<td valign="top">What a view - it must be great on fine days!  I like the way that the trees are divided into bands by the rain as we look into the distance</td>', 'What a view - it must be great on fine days!  I like the way that the trees are divided into bands by the rain as we look into the distance', '2006-09-28 07:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871736, 400121, 47541, '<td valign="top">This works ok but I find that the path overpowers the dog and therefore the most interesting aspect of the image, the way you have captured the rain falling, is now secondary</td>', 'This works ok but I find that the path overpowers the dog and therefore the most interesting aspect of the image, the way you have captured the rain falling, is now secondary', '2006-09-28 07:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871737, 402161, 61191, '<td valign="top">Love the detail! Great job.</td>', 'Love the detail! Great job.', '2006-09-28 07:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871741, 402038, 47541, '<td valign="top">Thats great - I assume you rotated this or you didnt and used the garden hose :)<br/> <br/>The power converyed by the water is great and the water at the top shows this best.  I''d like more of that and less of the plant</td>', 'Thats great - I assume you rotated this or you didnt and used the garden hose :) The power converyed by the water is great and the water at the top shows this best.  I''d like more of that and less of the plant', '2006-09-28 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871746, 402165, 47541, '<td valign="top">The trees hide too much of the lightning to capture the drama and interest usually seen in lightning shots</td>', 'The trees hide too much of the lightning to capture the drama and interest usually seen in lightning shots', '2006-09-28 07:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871747, 401728, 61191, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot! I love her facial expression. She looks filled with joy. Lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Stunning shot! I love her facial expression. She looks filled with joy. Lighting is excellent.', '2006-09-28 07:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871749, 398869, 47541, '<td valign="top">A nice image and I like the idea.  The light seems a bit harsh in places though</td>', 'A nice image and I like the idea.  The light seems a bit harsh in places though', '2006-09-28 07:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871751, 401897, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great dark and moody shot.</td>', 'Great dark and moody shot.', '2006-09-28 07:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871752, 401752, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good lightning capture and  the way it "hits" behind the tree is good as it leads our eye all the way down to that tree</td>', 'A good lightning capture and  the way it "hits" behind the tree is good as it leads our eye all the way down to that tree', '2006-09-28 07:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871754, 400720, 47541, '<td valign="top">Some interesting circles being formed by the water - this is good to view as there is interest all over the image</td>', 'Some interesting circles being formed by the water - this is good to view as there is interest all over the image', '2006-09-28 07:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871757, 400140, 47541, '<td valign="top">I feel this is a little DNMC for a rain challenge but I still give a 6.  I like the grainy feel of the light breaking through the tree</td>', 'I feel this is a little DNMC for a rain challenge but I still give a 6.  I like the grainy feel of the light breaking through the tree', '2006-09-28 07:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871758, 402131, 47541, '<td valign="top">I dont get the title.  The image itself is nice but I find the lighting on the hand a little too strong as I dont really "see" the water when I look at this</td>', 'I dont get the title.  The image itself is nice but I find the lighting on the hand a little too strong as I dont really "see" the water when I look at this', '2006-09-28 07:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871759, 401336, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice and interesting.  A good DOF for the size of the water drops and the colour at the top ensures another interesting element</td>', 'Nice and interesting.  A good DOF for the size of the water drops and the colour at the top ensures another interesting element', '2006-09-28 07:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871764, 402038, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great idea, something different and very creative. Lighting is great.</td>', 'Great idea, something different and very creative. Lighting is great.', '2006-09-28 07:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871766, 402150, 61191, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, well done!</td>', 'Funny shot, well done!', '2006-09-28 07:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871767, 401738, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: I find myself being drawn to look at the building in the background in this image.  As they are slightly OOF I then get disappointed.  I guess the cyclists dont seem to be doing enough interesting for me to hold on them.  The lady in the white coat seems to be looking at you :)</td>', '6: I find myself being drawn to look at the building in the background in this image.  As they are slightly OOF I then get disappointed.  I guess the cyclists dont seem to be doing enough interesting for me to hold on them.  The lady in the white coat seems to be looking at you :)', '2006-09-28 07:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871770, 402246, 47541, '<td valign="top">The shadows cast on the landscape here is the best part of this image.  It''s an interesting landscape to start with but the shadow stops it being too uniform</td>', 'The shadows cast on the landscape here is the best part of this image.  It''s an interesting landscape to start with but the shadow stops it being too uniform', '2006-09-28 07:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871773, 402078, 47541, '<td valign="top">The rings in the water are great but I find the huge leaf doesnt really fit well with them to make a coherent image</td>', 'The rings in the water are great but I find the huge leaf doesnt really fit well with them to make a coherent image', '2006-09-28 07:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871774, 401812, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: Nice capture of water on leaves - nice DOF</td>', '6: Nice capture of water on leaves - nice DOF', '2006-09-28 07:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871778, 401196, 47541, '<td valign="top">I have trouble understanding that title!  The bear capture is good but that bright blue at the top-left jumps out at me first</td>', 'I have trouble understanding that title!  The bear capture is good but that bright blue at the top-left jumps out at me first', '2006-09-28 07:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871780, 399719, 47541, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge.  I think it would be a better image without the car and if the "S" of the road we rotated to the right slightly</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge.  I think it would be a better image without the car and if the "S" of the road we rotated to the right slightly', '2006-09-28 07:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871781, 401271, 47541, '<td valign="top">Id have liked a tighter crop on this to really focus on some interesting rings in particular.  As it is there are some interesting drops in the water but they are too far apart to work together as a single image</td>', 'Id have liked a tighter crop on this to really focus on some interesting rings in particular.  As it is there are some interesting drops in the water but they are too far apart to work together as a single image', '2006-09-28 07:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871785, 398819, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good capture but a smaller DOF may have helped draw my attention to the main leaf</td>', 'A good capture but a smaller DOF may have helped draw my attention to the main leaf', '2006-09-28 07:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871788, 401420, 47541, '<td valign="top">All that water on such a bright day - did you use the garden hose?!?<br/> <br/>The image is nice enough but I really want to see more of the girls face, maybe if you had her turn toward you a bit more</td>', 'All that water on such a bright day - did you use the garden hose?!? The image is nice enough but I really want to see more of the girls face, maybe if you had her turn toward you a bit more', '2006-09-28 07:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871791, 401873, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice and close to the web which gives us lots of interesting patterns to look at in the water</td>', 'Nice and close to the web which gives us lots of interesting patterns to look at in the water', '2006-09-28 07:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871792, 401039, 47541, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 because for some reason I like it even thought everything seems OOF</td>', 'I gave this a 6 because for some reason I like it even thought everything seems OOF', '2006-09-28 07:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871796, 401270, 47541, '<td valign="top">Such an interesting subject to use but I feel 2 things could have been improved on: (1) a tighter crop on the mushrooms and (2) the light on them seesm a bit harsh</td>', 'Such an interesting subject to use but I feel 2 things could have been improved on: (1) a tighter crop on the mushrooms and (2) the light on them seesm a bit harsh', '2006-09-28 08:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871798, 399402, 47541, '<td valign="top">The title doesnt seem to work with the image.  The rings in the water are great.  The shadow adds intersdt but also overpowers things a bit</td>', 'The title doesnt seem to work with the image.  The rings in the water are great.  The shadow adds intersdt but also overpowers things a bit', '2006-09-28 08:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871800, 401704, 47541, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic colour combination with the green and purple</td>', 'What a fantastic colour combination with the green and purple', '2006-09-28 08:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871802, 399446, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the shallow DOF draws me to the front edge of the leaf and away from the drop at the tip</td>', 'Nice composition but the shallow DOF draws me to the front edge of the leaf and away from the drop at the tip', '2006-09-28 08:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871805, 400092, 47541, '<td valign="top">I dont really get an "after the storm" feel from this - still a 6 though</td>', 'I dont really get an "after the storm" feel from this - still a 6 though', '2006-09-28 08:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871806, 400106, 47541, '<td valign="top">Cool umbrealla!  Level the horizon up and place the model more to the right of the frame</td>', 'Cool umbrealla!  Level the horizon up and place the model more to the right of the frame', '2006-09-28 08:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871809, 402144, 47541, '<td valign="top">A wonderful simple idea.  The DOF on the line is good but I am slightly distracted by the busy background</td>', 'A wonderful simple idea.  The DOF on the line is good but I am slightly distracted by the busy background', '2006-09-28 08:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871813, 401300, 47541, '<td valign="top">Unique composition but the "thing" near the bottom left is out of place in this shot I feel</td>', 'Unique composition but the "thing" near the bottom left is out of place in this shot I feel', '2006-09-28 08:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871814, 401667, 47541, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and while there is a lot in the frame it doesnt feel too busy</td>', 'Lovely colours and while there is a lot in the frame it doesnt feel too busy', '2006-09-28 08:09:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2871817, 398677, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice colour choice.  Feels a little OOF to me though</td>', 'Nice colour choice.  Feels a little OOF to me though', '2006-09-28 08:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871819, 399635, 47541, '<td valign="top">I love the way the cars look though the window.  I think you should have cropped out the wiper at the bottom though</td>', 'I love the way the cars look though the window.  I think you should have cropped out the wiper at the bottom though', '2006-09-28 08:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871825, 402040, 47541, '<td valign="top">The colours of the grass and bike stand out well and you have managed to not let them overpower the shot - nice composition</td>', 'The colours of the grass and bike stand out well and you have managed to not let them overpower the shot - nice composition', '2006-09-28 08:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871828, 400805, 47541, '<td valign="top">I like the way the flames reflect in the window in a manner that makes it feel like the reflections are "in" the rain</td>', 'I like the way the flames reflect in the window in a manner that makes it feel like the reflections are "in" the rain', '2006-09-28 08:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871831, 400662, 47541, '<td valign="top">A great idea but the dark band at the bottom and the overall cloudy feel make this a 6</td>', 'A great idea but the dark band at the bottom and the overall cloudy feel make this a 6', '2006-09-28 08:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871837, 402257, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and good use of the empty space to draw attention to the water drop</td>', 'Nice DOF and good use of the empty space to draw attention to the water drop', '2006-09-28 08:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871838, 401306, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good idea but the bright light in the water drops this to a 6</td>', 'A good idea but the bright light in the water drops this to a 6', '2006-09-28 08:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871841, 401897, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: Great composition.  Just a few too many areas in darkness for my liking :(</td>', '6: Great composition.  Just a few too many areas in darkness for my liking :(', '2006-09-28 08:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871846, 402212, 48954, '<td valign="top">hehe, love the look. too bad there isn''t any rain in the shot. I like the spinning umbrella as well. good luck</td>', 'hehe, love the look. too bad there isn''t any rain in the shot. I like the spinning umbrella as well. good luck', '2006-09-28 08:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871851, 400763, 48954, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, focus needs some work here and i find that if there were no title to the shot, the viewer wouldn''t know what to look at. The ripple doesn''t really catch my eye and the rock is distracting. good luck</td>', 'Hmmm, focus needs some work here and i find that if there were no title to the shot, the viewer wouldn''t know what to look at. The ripple doesn''t really catch my eye and the rock is distracting. good luck', '2006-09-28 08:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871861, 400079, 48954, '<td valign="top">I know what you are trying to get at but a picture of a wet windshield with smudges on it does make it very interesting photography. Maybe if the drops were bigger and the landscape in the back werre to be refracted in them. That could make it alot more interesting. As it is now, there something to see through that windshield but I can''t see it cause of those damn drops and smudges. Good luck</td>', 'I know what you are trying to get at but a picture of a wet windshield with smudges on it does make it very interesting photography. Maybe if the drops were bigger and the landscape in the back werre to be refracted in them. That could make it alot more interesting. As it is now, there something to see through that windshield but I can''t see it cause of those damn drops and smudges. Good luck', '2006-09-28 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871865, 398783, 48954, '<td valign="top">It would have been really cool if the drops were sharp as hell with a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'It would have been really cool if the drops were sharp as hell with a faster shutter speed.', '2006-09-28 08:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871870, 402131, 34938, '<td valign="top">superb! great still motion</td>', 'superb! great still motion', '2006-09-28 08:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871871, 401873, 48954, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very cool idea. To bad the background isn''t a little more interesting, cause then it would have made the refracted images in the drops that much cooler.</td>', 'Wow. Very cool idea. To bad the background isn''t a little more interesting, cause then it would have made the refracted images in the drops that much cooler.', '2006-09-28 08:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871873, 400240, 48954, '<td valign="top">could be sharper and the colours seem to be over saturated.</td>', 'could be sharper and the colours seem to be over saturated.', '2006-09-28 08:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871875, 402092, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely image...the drop is perfect!</td>', 'lovely image...the drop is perfect!', '2006-09-28 08:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871877, 401683, 48954, '<td valign="top">very cool. great colours and the zoom out effect is super effective. good luck. hope you do well</td>', 'very cool. great colours and the zoom out effect is super effective. good luck. hope you do well', '2006-09-28 08:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871881, 401386, 48954, '<td valign="top">The picture has a funny haze to it. it kinda looks like a picture of a picture...and there''s no rain.</td>', 'The picture has a funny haze to it. it kinda looks like a picture of a picture...and there''s no rain.', '2006-09-28 08:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
