(2871896, 401039, 48954, '<td valign="top">Hmm, focus is lacking and the all around of the quality of the image (as in the image and not the photography) isn''t great. Although the composition in interesting. Good use of colours, division of frame with the water, blue and trees.</td>', 'Hmm, focus is lacking and the all around of the quality of the image (as in the image and not the photography) isn''t great. Although the composition in interesting. Good use of colours, division of frame with the water, blue and trees.', '2006-09-28 08:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
