(2873171, 399867, 9504, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo!!  Quiet good, but where is the rain?  I''d like to see rain drops in the water.</td>', 'Awesome photo!!  Quiet good, but where is the rain?  I''d like to see rain drops in the water.', '2006-09-28 16:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2873172, 401873, 9504, '<td valign="top">I just LOVE this shot.  Simply fabulous. Should be a top-placer! 10</td>', 'I just LOVE this shot.  Simply fabulous. Should be a top-placer! 10', '2006-09-28 16:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
