(2877893, 401924, 63888, '<td valign="top">This pic is a bit busy. Maybe a bit more emphasis on the subjects is needed. You could also try some other technique to bring out the fact that it is raining, maybe a slower shutter or something. Nice try however.</td>', 'This pic is a bit busy. Maybe a bit more emphasis on the subjects is needed. You could also try some other technique to bring out the fact that it is raining, maybe a slower shutter or something. Nice try however.', '2006-09-30 13:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
