(2878063, 402246, 62807, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo of the Badlands, love the contrast of darkness of the clouds in the top right against the sunshine brightness of the erosion in the bottom left. Great job!   10!</td>', 'Nice Photo of the Badlands, love the contrast of darkness of the clouds in the top right against the sunshine brightness of the erosion in the bottom left. Great job!   10!', '2006-09-30 14:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878064, 402109, 62807, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast of the umbrella against the greys!</td>', 'Love the contrast of the umbrella against the greys!', '2006-09-30 14:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878065, 399867, 62807, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking! Love the colors!</td>', 'Breathtaking! Love the colors!', '2006-09-30 14:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878066, 400662, 62807, '<td valign="top">You can''t "feel" the rain any better than this! Great job! 10!</td>', 'You can''t "feel" the rain any better than this! Great job! 10!', '2006-09-30 14:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878067, 401752, 62807, '<td valign="top">Love it!!! 10!</td>', 'Love it!!! 10!', '2006-09-30 14:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878069, 402252, 62807, '<td valign="top">Great way to capture the rain! I love how her dress stands out against all the black and grey! She should be inside having fun and it looks like that is where she would rathter be!!! Crisp and sharp, Awesome job... 10!</td>', 'Great way to capture the rain! I love how her dress stands out against all the black and grey! She should be inside having fun and it looks like that is where she would rathter be!!! Crisp and sharp, Awesome job... 10!', '2006-09-30 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878070, 402217, 62807, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!!</td>', 'Stunning!!!', '2006-09-30 14:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878171, 401738, 57260, '<td valign="top">I love the atmosphere of this photo</td>', 'I love the atmosphere of this photo', '2006-09-30 16:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878178, 401791, 57260, '<td valign="top">Technichally the composition looks fair but I find the picture uninteresting. Also I would''ve used a greater DOP to get everything in focus - I don''t particularly like the fact that only the middle band of the picture is in focus.</td>', 'Technichally the composition looks fair but I find the picture uninteresting. Also I would''ve used a greater DOP to get everything in focus - I don''t particularly like the fact that only the middle band of the picture is in focus.', '2006-09-30 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
