(2878447, 402082, 42984, '<td valign="top">Like the composition a lot. It''s a shame it didn''t come out as sharp as you''d hoped.  Do you know about having to sharpen after you reduce it to 640x</td>', 'Like the composition a lot. It''s a shame it didn''t come out as sharp as you''d hoped.  Do you know about having to sharpen after you reduce it to 640x', '2006-09-30 19:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
