(2878452, 401745, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  That one wouldn''t have been easy.  Composing (if you had the time) with the fly on the left vertical thrids line would have given an even greater feeling of little fly on big empty space and added even more to the impact.  Good work.</td>', 'Great capture!  That one wouldn''t have been easy.  Composing (if you had the time) with the fly on the left vertical thrids line would have given an even greater feeling of little fly on big empty space and added even more to the impact.  Good work.', '2006-09-30 19:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878453, 400695, 42984, '<td valign="top">This imaghe has some really good light values and elements.  There''s a lot in this picture, much of it in conflict.  Collectively they actually deduct from parts of it that are really powerful.  The rain has stopped.  The "freedom" is presumably the bird (which is out of focus).  The sculpture is stunning but the background jetty and buildings take away its shape.  The people , the flagstones and their relationship to the iron sculpture are really strong but become lost in the rest iof it.  I''d love to see this as a study from an angle that loses the background dtructures</td>', 'This imaghe has some really good light values and elements.  There''s a lot in this picture, much of it in conflict.  Collectively they actually deduct from parts of it that are really powerful.  The rain has stopped.  The "freedom" is presumably the bird (which is out of focus).  The sculpture is stunning but the background jetty and buildings take away its shape.  The people , the flagstones and their relationship to the iron sculpture are really strong but become lost in the rest iof it.  I''d love to see this as a study from an angle that loses the background dtructures', '2006-09-30 19:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878454, 401925, 42984, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool really.  I originally thought it too underexposed but I tend to think that it''s more the on-cameraa flash that''s flattening it rather than the exposure</td>', 'That''s pretty cool really.  I originally thought it too underexposed but I tend to think that it''s more the on-cameraa flash that''s flattening it rather than the exposure', '2006-09-30 19:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878455, 398869, 42984, '<td valign="top">At least (for once) it wasn''t her best shoes :)  Nice work</td>', 'At least (for once) it wasn''t her best shoes :)  Nice work', '2006-09-30 19:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878458, 399635, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good idea and take on the challenge.  It probably lacks enough "wow" factor to crack the top 20 but it''s a good piece of work.</td>', 'Good idea and take on the challenge.  It probably lacks enough "wow" factor to crack the top 20 but it''s a good piece of work.', '2006-09-30 19:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878459, 401796, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great study, well done</td>', 'This is a great study, well done', '2006-09-30 19:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878465, 402199, 42984, '<td valign="top">Oooh the colours and contrast here is really strong!  The great complimentary colours of the blue/red/yellow, the clarity and sharpness of the water drops and the tilt make this so strong. What I think will let it down in the voting is that a great deal of its impact is lost by too much detail in the background.  This seems to draw the eye away from the real stars of the shot (photographically) which are the slide''s elements.  Maybe the swings are important to the story but I feel are less important to the photograph.<br/> <br/>I would be really interested to see the result of you masking all of the background and putting a blur on it as if you''d used short depth of field.</td>', 'Oooh the colours and contrast here is really strong!  The great complimentary colours of the blue/red/yellow, the clarity and sharpness of the water drops and the tilt make this so strong. What I think will let it down in the voting is that a great deal of its impact is lost by too much detail in the background.  This seems to draw the eye away from the real stars of the shot (photographically) which are the slide''s elements.  Maybe the swings are important to the story but I feel are less important to the photograph. I would be really interested to see the result of you masking all of the background and putting a blur on it as if you''d used short depth of field.', '2006-09-30 20:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878467, 402150, 42984, '<td valign="top">Top shot and difficult to get at any time with bugs that don''t like to stay still.</td>', 'Top shot and difficult to get at any time with bugs that don''t like to stay still.', '2006-09-30 20:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878481, 399719, 42984, '<td valign="top">It works really well doesn''t it.  At last, an image with great rain and a context in which to put it.  I love the colouration so typical of a day like that.  In composition, you have the low left tree balanced by the high right tree with the wind of the raod giving it balance and flow.  I''d be interested in your view of chopping the bottom quarter off the image so that you have the foreground grass just at the edge of the road in bottom-left frame.  I bet that would have been worth a whole lot of extra points in the voting.  You would have had an image much wider too as a result to help viewing</td>', 'It works really well doesn''t it.  At last, an image with great rain and a context in which to put it.  I love the colouration so typical of a day like that.  In composition, you have the low left tree balanced by the high right tree with the wind of the raod giving it balance and flow.  I''d be interested in your view of chopping the bottom quarter off the image so that you have the foreground grass just at the edge of the road in bottom-left frame.  I bet that would have been worth a whole lot of extra points in the voting.  You would have had an image much wider too as a result to help viewing', '2006-09-30 20:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878500, 401336, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good capture and treatment - very hard to get a wow factor into it too.</td>', 'Good capture and treatment - very hard to get a wow factor into it too.', '2006-09-30 20:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878501, 400106, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cool, cute take on the challenge</td>', 'Cool, cute take on the challenge', '2006-09-30 20:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878505, 400803, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love the concept, the elements are all there.  For some reason my eye is first drawn to the sofa and i missed the rain on the window.  The person being just hair is a little distracting.  It seems that maybe if the foregroung objects were more out of focus, the window and rain would domniate more</td>', 'Love the concept, the elements are all there.  For some reason my eye is first drawn to the sofa and i missed the rain on the window.  The person being just hair is a little distracting.  It seems that maybe if the foregroung objects were more out of focus, the window and rain would domniate more', '2006-09-30 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878507, 401812, 42984, '<td valign="top">Sweet macro with good lens effect of the drops.  Well done</td>', 'Sweet macro with good lens effect of the drops.  Well done', '2006-09-30 20:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878514, 402131, 42984, '<td valign="top">Strong strong image which is slightly depreciated by streetlight in the title.  I do feel too that more black/rain to the top and left would add exponential impact to this</td>', 'Strong strong image which is slightly depreciated by streetlight in the title.  I do feel too that more black/rain to the top and left would add exponential impact to this', '2006-09-30 20:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878615, 401704, 11800, '<td valign="top">nice colors and an ok comp. The object is a bike I suppose, but unless the photographer includes more hints, it will confuse the voters and garner a mid to low vote.<br/>Personally, I like how the purple stands out from the green but I find the dof on the grass to intrusive.</td>', 'nice colors and an ok comp. The object is a bike I suppose, but unless the photographer includes more hints, it will confuse the voters and garner a mid to low vote.Personally, I like how the purple stands out from the green but I find the dof on the grass to intrusive.', '2006-09-30 21:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878629, 401830, 11800, '<td valign="top">I love these kind of shots. Lines on lines like a well written poem. <br/>The size of the picture and the less than sharp focus will cause the voters to score this in the mid to low range. Did you try this as a b/w? gl</td>', 'I love these kind of shots. Lines on lines like a well written poem. The size of the picture and the less than sharp focus will cause the voters to score this in the mid to low range. Did you try this as a b/w? gl', '2006-09-30 21:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878647, 401683, 25355, '<td valign="top">very cool effect. I just wish the bright white spot wasn''t so ... bright and white. ;&gt;þ</td>', 'very cool effect. I just wish the bright white spot wasn''t so ... bright and white. ;>þ', '2006-09-30 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878692, 401925, 11800, '<td valign="top">nice try at the shot. The flash has caused some hot spots. It helps to have an off camera flash when attempting these kinds of shots. That way you can place it to the side and lower so not as many hot spots are made. When I did mine, I also had another light above and to the right to even out the exposure. It was a worklight.<br/>Keep practicing, I''m sure you will have it perfected in no time.</td>', 'nice try at the shot. The flash has caused some hot spots. It helps to have an off camera flash when attempting these kinds of shots. That way you can place it to the side and lower so not as many hot spots are made. When I did mine, I also had another light above and to the right to even out the exposure. It was a worklight.Keep practicing, I''m sure you will have it perfected in no time.', '2006-09-30 21:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878709, 400784, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I can''t see what it is.  a leaf maybe, but what is causing all the ripples? I like it.<br/>The noise, the mystery and the brightness of the water might lose points for this photograph in the voting stage.</td>', 'Interesting. I can''t see what it is.  a leaf maybe, but what is causing all the ripples? I like it.The noise, the mystery and the brightness of the water might lose points for this photograph in the voting stage.', '2006-09-30 21:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878724, 402144, 11800, '<td valign="top">good tones. <br/>I have come to the conclusion that the reason I find foreground bokeh displeasing is because it disorients me. Two of the strands look larger so my mind says they are in front but my eyes keep telling me they are in the background so I don''t know what to think.</td>', 'good tones. I have come to the conclusion that the reason I find foreground bokeh displeasing is because it disorients me. Two of the strands look larger so my mind says they are in front but my eyes keep telling me they are in the background so I don''t know what to think.', '2006-09-30 21:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878736, 401683, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like how the traces look like some type of fabric. I wonder if the hot spots are going to cost the picture some points during voting. It is a nice departure from the other pictures.</td>', 'I like how the traces look like some type of fabric. I wonder if the hot spots are going to cost the picture some points during voting. It is a nice departure from the other pictures.', '2006-09-30 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878745, 398819, 11800, '<td valign="top">my garden said the same thing! <br/>I have found that a simple composition usually works well for water shots. Pare it down to just one thing and place that one thing in one of the rule of thirds position and you could have a winner. Not that I''ve ever won here, lol.</td>', 'my garden said the same thing! I have found that a simple composition usually works well for water shots. Pare it down to just one thing and place that one thing in one of the rule of thirds position and you could have a winner. Not that I''ve ever won here, lol.', '2006-09-30 21:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878764, 402046, 11800, '<td valign="top">I wish they had such cute rain boots when I was a kid!<br/>I notice a blue cast to the photo overall and expecially on her face. It makes her look cold. Usually, placing the subject off center adds more interest to a picture, but I''m not so sure about that in the case.</td>', 'I wish they had such cute rain boots when I was a kid!I notice a blue cast to the photo overall and expecially on her face. It makes her look cold. Usually, placing the subject off center adds more interest to a picture, but I''m not so sure about that in the case.', '2006-09-30 21:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878779, 402096, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in the drops and the choice of color. Composition wise, I might have cropped the right side so that the top water drop was in the upper right rule of thirds position and maybe positioned the camera a little lower to get the second leaf above the black mass in the background. It''s a well timed shot though and I''d be proud of it.</td>', 'I like the contrast in the drops and the choice of color. Composition wise, I might have cropped the right side so that the top water drop was in the upper right rule of thirds position and maybe positioned the camera a little lower to get the second leaf above the black mass in the background. It''s a well timed shot though and I''d be proud of it.', '2006-09-30 21:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878782, 400804, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the little guy.</td>', 'Nice light on the little guy.', '2006-09-30 22:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878794, 402078, 11800, '<td valign="top">The case of the missing waterdrop. It looks like a shadow on the leaf, as if it''s a few inches under water. But the leaf is barely under so it is a water drop on the leaf itself. I probably would have liked seeing the whole leaf, but I can see the water drops were an important part of the story.</td>', 'The case of the missing waterdrop. It looks like a shadow on the leaf, as if it''s a few inches under water. But the leaf is barely under so it is a water drop on the leaf itself. I probably would have liked seeing the whole leaf, but I can see the water drops were an important part of the story.', '2006-09-30 22:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2878806, 402199, 11800, '<td valign="top">I wonder if there was a way to pare this picture down to just one or two things so that there was one subject. I like the color and the small drops on the red part.</td>', 'I wonder if there was a way to pare this picture down to just one or two things so that there was one subject. I like the color and the small drops on the red part.', '2006-09-30 22:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
