(2879017, 400805, 11800, '<td valign="top">The focus might have been better placed on the candle holders even though the window is showing the rain for the challenge. I think the voters would have been able to see that even if it wasn''t in focus. <br/>It looks like the right holder is more in focus but a lot of people read from left to right and that carries over to photos. By seeing the left holder first, one assumes the right one isn''t in focus either, especially in a symetrical composition. The voters will spend about 3 seconds looking at the picture and will naturally jump to conclusions.</td>', 'The focus might have been better placed on the candle holders even though the window is showing the rain for the challenge. I think the voters would have been able to see that even if it wasn''t in focus. It looks like the right holder is more in focus but a lot of people read from left to right and that carries over to photos. By seeing the left holder first, one assumes the right one isn''t in focus either, especially in a symetrical composition. The voters will spend about 3 seconds looking at the picture and will naturally jump to conclusions.', '2006-09-30 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2879025, 399395, 11800, '<td valign="top">Hope this ends up in the top 10. Gutsy. At first I thought it was someone just picking up a leaf. The title tells a good story.</td>', 'Hope this ends up in the top 10. Gutsy. At first I thought it was someone just picking up a leaf. The title tells a good story.', '2006-09-30 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2879064, 401837, 11800, '<td valign="top">I just want to mention that when I look at pictures, I feel disappointed when I see the subject cut off without a good reason. Maybe I''m old fashioned in that respect. <br/>To me, the center leaf is the subject. There was plenty of room to get the whole leaf into the frame. But I''m probably not understanding the picture right.</td>', 'I just want to mention that when I look at pictures, I feel disappointed when I see the subject cut off without a good reason. Maybe I''m old fashioned in that respect. To me, the center leaf is the subject. There was plenty of room to get the whole leaf into the frame. But I''m probably not understanding the picture right.', '2006-09-30 23:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
