(2883507, 401723, 11800, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of little things that make it likeable. The sunburst effect of the two drops, the alignment of the flowers, the nice bokeh. But in the end the overall presentation is lacking. I don''t know what to tell you.</td>', 'This has a lot of little things that make it likeable. The sunburst effect of the two drops, the alignment of the flowers, the nice bokeh. But in the end the overall presentation is lacking. I don''t know what to tell you.', '2006-10-01 18:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883535, 400240, 11800, '<td valign="top">It looks overexposed and the magenta/pink is oversaturated. I avoid magenta because it is the most difficult color to work with. It seems to not have much forgivness in it as far as color clipping goes.</td>', 'It looks overexposed and the magenta/pink is oversaturated. I avoid magenta because it is the most difficult color to work with. It seems to not have much forgivness in it as far as color clipping goes.', '2006-10-01 18:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883539, 401320, 38496, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  I like the wet look.</td>', 'This is cool.  I like the wet look.', '2006-10-01 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883547, 402150, 38496, '<td valign="top">cute title.  Nice detail.</td>', 'cute title.  Nice detail.', '2006-10-01 18:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883594, 400763, 11800, '<td valign="top">Lets consider the things that have been framed here. The ripple, the grass and that big out-of-focus thing(I have no idea what it is) that is taking up 1/3 of the frame. What is it that you wanted the voters to see? The ripple. When composing, keep in mind that you want to limit the things in the frame to only what you want the viewer to see. Your score will be sure to improve.</td>', 'Lets consider the things that have been framed here. The ripple, the grass and that big out-of-focus thing(I have no idea what it is) that is taking up 1/3 of the frame. What is it that you wanted the voters to see? The ripple. When composing, keep in mind that you want to limit the things in the frame to only what you want the viewer to see. Your score will be sure to improve.', '2006-10-01 18:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883641, 400613, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit awkward. You have tried to cut down on the distractions within the frame. That is one of the hardest parts for me. Maybe the curves adjustment caused the color problem. I almost always convert to b/w when the colors start going goofy. With the pcture as it is, the voters will knock off points for the color, with b/w you would not lose those points.</td>', 'The colors are a bit awkward. You have tried to cut down on the distractions within the frame. That is one of the hardest parts for me. Maybe the curves adjustment caused the color problem. I almost always convert to b/w when the colors start going goofy. With the pcture as it is, the voters will knock off points for the color, with b/w you would not lose those points.', '2006-10-01 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883699, 401643, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me, the best part of a water drop picture is the water drops themselves. In this picture that area of the frame is dark. Is it important that the viewer knows the season? Why is the green section included?  Just some things to think about.</td>', 'To me, the best part of a water drop picture is the water drops themselves. In this picture that area of the frame is dark. Is it important that the viewer knows the season? Why is the green section included?  Just some things to think about.', '2006-10-01 18:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883734, 400230, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the green curve and the distorted garden tool toys. The  turtle face and the castle distract from that. Composing this tighter and moving the castle out of the way would have created a very pleasant picture.</td>', 'I like the green curve and the distorted garden tool toys. The  turtle face and the castle distract from that. Composing this tighter and moving the castle out of the way would have created a very pleasant picture.', '2006-10-01 18:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883769, 398869, 11800, '<td valign="top">The on-camera flash is causing shadows and has washed out some of the color. The color combination is good. Overall the photo doesn''t have a lot of impact but I wouldn''t know what to say to help you get a better score. Even if natural light was used, I don''t think this would be a high scorer because of the subject matter.</td>', 'The on-camera flash is causing shadows and has washed out some of the color. The color combination is good. Overall the photo doesn''t have a lot of impact but I wouldn''t know what to say to help you get a better score. Even if natural light was used, I don''t think this would be a high scorer because of the subject matter.', '2006-10-01 18:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883774, 402199, 41554, '<td valign="top">I think the red slider is overpowering in this image... I would either have less of it or more (maybe a macro of the water drops on those cool curves) of it, as is it throws the pic off balance, at least for me.</td>', 'I think the red slider is overpowering in this image... I would either have less of it or more (maybe a macro of the water drops on those cool curves) of it, as is it throws the pic off balance, at least for me.', '2006-10-01 18:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883780, 398819, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, maybe if that brownish straw wasn''t there, this would be better... also a tighter crop might help.</td>', 'Nice lines, maybe if that brownish straw wasn''t there, this would be better... also a tighter crop might help.', '2006-10-01 18:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883796, 401478, 41554, '<td valign="top">Hey this is nice. I would have cropped out the washed-out sky, or at least most of it, it isn''t adding anything to the pic, IMHO...</td>', 'Hey this is nice. I would have cropped out the washed-out sky, or at least most of it, it isn''t adding anything to the pic, IMHO...', '2006-10-01 18:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883804, 399754, 41554, '<td valign="top">Considering the beaten-to-death "subject behind wet glass" pic style, this is one of the nicest of this challenge.</td>', 'Considering the beaten-to-death "subject behind wet glass" pic style, this is one of the nicest of this challenge.', '2006-10-01 18:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883818, 402161, 41554, '<td valign="top">Hey give the poor guy a hankie! Very nice macro, in fact, one of the best shots in the challenge techincally speaking. Good job!</td>', 'Hey give the poor guy a hankie! Very nice macro, in fact, one of the best shots in the challenge techincally speaking. Good job!', '2006-10-01 18:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883832, 401386, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nothing of interest in this one. The sky?... Not enough contrast to bring the clouds out... the setting? uninteresting and dull. And on top of all that, it''s a bit blurred. Sorry, not a winner.</td>', 'Nothing of interest in this one. The sky?... Not enough contrast to bring the clouds out... the setting? uninteresting and dull. And on top of all that, it''s a bit blurred. Sorry, not a winner.', '2006-10-01 18:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883851, 401038, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Ugly spider.</td>', 'Nice job. Ugly spider.', '2006-10-01 19:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883865, 402131, 41554, '<td valign="top">Good composition... the clarity on the hands is very nice, good shot.</td>', 'Good composition... the clarity on the hands is very nice, good shot.', '2006-10-01 19:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883869, 402031, 41554, '<td valign="top">Good idea... nice colours on the reflections also.</td>', 'Good idea... nice colours on the reflections also.', '2006-10-01 19:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883874, 402257, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''ve come to the conclusion that waterdrops have to be placed at stragetic places to have impact. The best place is at the tip of whatever is holding the drop. In this case, the tip of the blade of grass. <br/>Now let''s look at the composition. The subject has been isolated as much as possible which is good. But is all the background needed? What impression does the piece of cut grass give to the viewer? And that brown piece behind the subject? Would tilting the camera help? If the blade of grass would have a upwards or downwards tilt would it be more dynamic?</td>', 'I''ve come to the conclusion that waterdrops have to be placed at stragetic places to have impact. The best place is at the tip of whatever is holding the drop. In this case, the tip of the blade of grass. Now let''s look at the composition. The subject has been isolated as much as possible which is good. But is all the background needed? What impression does the piece of cut grass give to the viewer? And that brown piece behind the subject? Would tilting the camera help? If the blade of grass would have a upwards or downwards tilt would it be more dynamic?', '2006-10-01 19:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883905, 399635, 11800, '<td valign="top">My first impression is that there was a lot of smoothing done in post processing so that there is no definition in either the rain drops or the outside scene. I like how rain distorts things but there isn''t that part left to this picture. The dashboard could be cropped out without messing up the composition.</td>', 'My first impression is that there was a lot of smoothing done in post processing so that there is no definition in either the rain drops or the outside scene. I like how rain distorts things but there isn''t that part left to this picture. The dashboard could be cropped out without messing up the composition.', '2006-10-01 19:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883935, 402096, 66041, '<td valign="top">Love the depth of field, but it could have been cropped more.   The out of focus clouds are really distracting, and are attracting my eye more than the drops should be.</td>', 'Love the depth of field, but it could have been cropped more.   The out of focus clouds are really distracting, and are attracting my eye more than the drops should be.', '2006-10-01 19:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883942, 402109, 66041, '<td valign="top">You should have entered this into the Purple challenge as well.  :)</td>', 'You should have entered this into the Purple challenge as well.  :)', '2006-10-01 19:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883955, 401312, 11800, '<td valign="top">I can see how the rose was offset in the composition. It''s a bit sad that the bud had to be cut off because I think it would have been a lovely addition to the composition. This might be a little overexposed but it could be because it was overcast and so there was a lack of shadows and that cut down on the contrast. Even so, underexposing might have brought out more detail.</td>', 'I can see how the rose was offset in the composition. It''s a bit sad that the bud had to be cut off because I think it would have been a lovely addition to the composition. This might be a little overexposed but it could be because it was overcast and so there was a lack of shadows and that cut down on the contrast. Even so, underexposing might have brought out more detail.', '2006-10-01 19:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883987, 399754, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice batik effect. I tried pumping up the sat a lot and it added a vibrancy to the picture. Personally, I''d have liked a darker rendition of this but this is nice also. It probably has a mid-range to lower score because of the sedate colors.</td>', 'Nice batik effect. I tried pumping up the sat a lot and it added a vibrancy to the picture. Personally, I''d have liked a darker rendition of this but this is nice also. It probably has a mid-range to lower score because of the sedate colors.', '2006-10-01 19:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884084, 402199, 43031, '<td valign="top">so they sat in the houes all that cold wet wet day. or is it cold cold wet day? luuurve the bright colors and the sharpness.</td>', 'so they sat in the houes all that cold wet wet day. or is it cold cold wet day? luuurve the bright colors and the sharpness.', '2006-10-01 19:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884100, 400712, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite well composed - although the out of focus echo of the tall stands on the right side is probably unfortunate - it draws the eye too far out of frame for good effect, I think.</td>', 'Quite well composed - although the out of focus echo of the tall stands on the right side is probably unfortunate - it draws the eye too far out of frame for good effect, I think.', '2006-10-01 19:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884111, 401738, 6999, '<td valign="top">By far the most interesting shot so far - and quite enjoyable. Some good compositional choices, but somehow I wish there were a little more of a dynamic to it - it lacks something, though I couldn''t say what.</td>', 'By far the most interesting shot so far - and quite enjoyable. Some good compositional choices, but somehow I wish there were a little more of a dynamic to it - it lacks something, though I couldn''t say what.', '2006-10-01 19:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884114, 401728, 66414, '<td valign="top">The expression of the model is so reflective of playing in the rain<br/>Great shot.</td>', 'The expression of the model is so reflective of playing in the rainGreat shot.', '2006-10-01 19:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884164, 400784, 62249, '<td valign="top">LIke the colors, like the geometry and abstraction. Good timing on catching the splash. Still, there''s something not quite spot on with this photo. I think I''d like this as a painting.</td>', 'LIke the colors, like the geometry and abstraction. Good timing on catching the splash. Still, there''s something not quite spot on with this photo. I think I''d like this as a painting.', '2006-10-01 20:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884174, 401312, 62249, '<td valign="top">The rose itself overwhelms the raindrops. Gotta look too hard for the drops. Also looks a little oversharpened and isn''t focused as sharply as it needs to be. Would benefit from even shallower DOF to blur the background more.</td>', 'The rose itself overwhelms the raindrops. Gotta look too hard for the drops. Also looks a little oversharpened and isn''t focused as sharply as it needs to be. Would benefit from even shallower DOF to blur the background more.', '2006-10-01 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884178, 401800, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range, but not a particularly interesting photo.</td>', 'Good tonal range, but not a particularly interesting photo.', '2006-10-01 20:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884188, 401683, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image with great texture and tonality. Not sure how it fits the challenge, though. What is it?</td>', 'Very interesting image with great texture and tonality. Not sure how it fits the challenge, though. What is it?', '2006-10-01 20:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884205, 399867, 62249, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty big puddle... Nice shot. Good tonal range.</td>', 'That''s a pretty big puddle... Nice shot. Good tonal range.', '2006-10-01 20:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884245, 400673, 62249, '<td valign="top">I get it. Had the same problem. (The rainy season in my area ended the week *before* the challenge was announced. Could be weeks or months before we get more rain.)<br/> <br/>Work on getting sharper focus in your photos. Also pay attention to muddy midtones. Need to see more detail in shadows.</td>', 'I get it. Had the same problem. (The rainy season in my area ended the week *before* the challenge was announced. Could be weeks or months before we get more rain.) Work on getting sharper focus in your photos. Also pay attention to muddy midtones. Need to see more detail in shadows.', '2006-10-01 20:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884256, 399881, 62249, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes this look staged rather than being real rain, but I still like the shot, especially the way the drops cast shadows on the leaves.</td>', 'The lighting makes this look staged rather than being real rain, but I still like the shot, especially the way the drops cast shadows on the leaves.', '2006-10-01 20:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884274, 399156, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Would like it cropped a little tighter on the bottom. A bit too much noise and could use slightly sharper focus on umbrella.</td>', 'Good composition. Would like it cropped a little tighter on the bottom. A bit too much noise and could use slightly sharper focus on umbrella.', '2006-10-01 20:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884296, 402150, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great title. Great shot.</td>', 'Great title. Great shot.', '2006-10-01 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884298, 402144, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and DOF, but tonal range is murky. Bump up the contrast.</td>', 'I like the composition and DOF, but tonal range is murky. Bump up the contrast.', '2006-10-01 20:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884301, 400805, 62249, '<td valign="top">Like the reflections. Focus needs work. Candlesticks should be sharper.</td>', 'Like the reflections. Focus needs work. Candlesticks should be sharper.', '2006-10-01 20:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884330, 402096, 62249, '<td valign="top">Not bad but I think I''d like it better with the right side cropped out. Like the silhouette and capture of the drops.</td>', 'Not bad but I think I''d like it better with the right side cropped out. Like the silhouette and capture of the drops.', '2006-10-01 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884353, 400695, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes &amp; subtle colors. Try cropping tighter. Too much foreground.</td>', 'I like the shapes & subtle colors. Try cropping tighter. Too much foreground.', '2006-10-01 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884377, 401667, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs more shadow detail. But nice composition.</td>', 'Needs more shadow detail. But nice composition.', '2006-10-01 20:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884525, 401898, 51556, '<td valign="top">really like it</td>', 'really like it', '2006-10-01 21:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884528, 401752, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice, good lightning shots arent easy</td>', 'nice, good lightning shots arent easy', '2006-10-01 21:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884538, 401667, 51556, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2006-10-01 21:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884544, 401850, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice shot,I wonder what it would look like ran through neat image?</td>', 'nice shot,I wonder what it would look like ran through neat image?', '2006-10-01 21:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884560, 402161, 51556, '<td valign="top">great shot,nice detail.could be a ribbon.10</td>', 'great shot,nice detail.could be a ribbon.10', '2006-10-01 21:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884569, 400327, 51556, '<td valign="top">This is really good.</td>', 'This is really good.', '2006-10-01 21:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884599, 401925, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice shot ,like the colors</td>', 'nice shot ,like the colors', '2006-10-01 21:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884616, 401812, 51556, '<td valign="top">ah,yes another leaf with water shot.Not bad though.</td>', 'ah,yes another leaf with water shot.Not bad though.', '2006-10-01 22:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884620, 399402, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice shot looks very abstract,I like it.</td>', 'nice shot looks very abstract,I like it.', '2006-10-01 22:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884654, 399604, 51556, '<td valign="top">Like the way it fades from dark to light,nice change from all the leaf with water on them shots.</td>', 'Like the way it fades from dark to light,nice change from all the leaf with water on them shots.', '2006-10-01 22:11:02.000000', NULL, 1);
