(2886763, 402212, 40580, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this one will do well.  However, I really like it.  He has a great expression. I dig the spinning unbrella.  Good luck.  I really hope it does well.</td>', 'I don''t think this one will do well.  However, I really like it.  He has a great expression. I dig the spinning unbrella.  Good luck.  I really hope it does well.', '2006-10-02 10:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
