(2887570, 401745, 48972, '<td valign="top">Like this photo, might be better from the top.  The leaf is throwing me off a little.</td>', 'Like this photo, might be better from the top.  The leaf is throwing me off a little.', '2006-10-02 15:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
