(2888235, 401728, 32507, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model.  Her expression gives this photo such a nice feeling.  The framing and capture of the rain is also nice.</td>', 'Beautiful model.  Her expression gives this photo such a nice feeling.  The framing and capture of the rain is also nice.', '2006-10-02 18:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
