(2892867, 402217, 66278, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-10-03 22:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2892868, 401850, 66278, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-10-03 22:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2892922, 398783, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, especially the streaks you were able to capture from the rain. Could also be interesting tilted so the rain''s coming down more at an angle.</td>', 'Nice abstract, especially the streaks you were able to capture from the rain. Could also be interesting tilted so the rain''s coming down more at an angle.', '2006-10-03 22:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2892933, 401659, 24970, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of interest in this shot, and good job making this drab color pallate really have life to it. The picture does seem pretty flat, did you try shooting at more of an angle to the cliff to allow some of the depth to show?</td>', 'There''s a lot of interest in this shot, and good job making this drab color pallate really have life to it. The picture does seem pretty flat, did you try shooting at more of an angle to the cliff to allow some of the depth to show?', '2006-10-03 22:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2892937, 401753, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great colors and dof. And it looks like the flower''s actually been rained on (naturally droopy) instead of spritzed like so many in this challenge seem to be. Composition works really well too.</td>', 'Great colors and dof. And it looks like the flower''s actually been rained on (naturally droopy) instead of spritzed like so many in this challenge seem to be. Composition works really well too.', '2006-10-03 22:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2892954, 401800, 24970, '<td valign="top">Your choice of b&amp;w really brought the focus to the people instead of the scenery (which I''m sure is gorgeous but not your subject) - well done.</td>', 'Your choice of b&w really brought the focus to the people instead of the scenery (which I''m sure is gorgeous but not your subject) - well done.', '2006-10-03 22:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2892968, 400230, 24970, '<td valign="top">I love it when people can turn everyday objects into fine photos. Composition works well. <br/>edit: I can''t believe this placed so low.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-04 00:39:45.</i></td>', 'I love it when people can turn everyday objects into fine photos. Composition works well. edit: I can''t believe this placed so low.', '2006-10-03 22:42:11.000000', '2006-10-04 01:39:45.000000', 1),
(2892983, 400803, 24970, '<td valign="top">Good perspective. I can barely tell that''s a face though, moving the hair back a tiny bit would have helped a lot I think. Definitely transmits that droopy feeling one gets when trapped inside for too long, though - good job.</td>', 'Good perspective. I can barely tell that''s a face though, moving the hair back a tiny bit would have helped a lot I think. Definitely transmits that droopy feeling one gets when trapped inside for too long, though - good job.', '2006-10-03 22:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893064, 400874, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like the movement you captured. This might have been even cooler as more of an abstract shot - get up higher and get the car out of the picture, leaving streaks of green and grey.</td>', 'I like the movement you captured. This might have been even cooler as more of an abstract shot - get up higher and get the car out of the picture, leaving streaks of green and grey.', '2006-10-03 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893076, 400127, 24970, '<td valign="top">I especially love the colors in this photo, along with the clarity of the needles. Nicely done.</td>', 'I especially love the colors in this photo, along with the clarity of the needles. Nicely done.', '2006-10-03 23:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893082, 402246, 24970, '<td valign="top">I love the light that emerges from under clouds like that. Gorgeous capture. Perhaps you could do a little more with the composition but I can''t tell what...so good job!</td>', 'I love the light that emerges from under clouds like that. Gorgeous capture. Perhaps you could do a little more with the composition but I can''t tell what...so good job!', '2006-10-03 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893086, 402231, 64610, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great image.  I like the dark clouds with the white horse in the background.  Great job!</td>', 'I think this is a great image.  I like the dark clouds with the white horse in the background.  Great job!', '2006-10-03 23:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893087, 401873, 64610, '<td valign="top">I like this image. I have seen a lot of webs and spiders but this is unique.  Great job!</td>', 'I like this image. I have seen a lot of webs and spiders but this is unique.  Great job!', '2006-10-03 23:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893093, 401728, 24970, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Just superb. Love her expression, the light, everything. I expect to see this on the front page in a couple of hours.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Just superb. Love her expression, the light, everything. I expect to see this on the front page in a couple of hours.', '2006-10-03 23:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893094, 401728, 64610, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, beautiful.</td>', 'Wonderful, beautiful.', '2006-10-03 23:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893095, 399604, 24970, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. A little grainy, but that''s ok. The gradient of color here is really great.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. A little grainy, but that''s ok. The gradient of color here is really great.', '2006-10-03 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893097, 401198, 24970, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity and lines in this shot. Hope it does well.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity and lines in this shot. Hope it does well.', '2006-10-03 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893099, 399402, 24970, '<td valign="top">I really like this. There are so many different shades and so much texture. The splash of green in the lower right (your plant?) really adds a lot. Best of the raindrops-hitting-water shots in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this. There are so many different shades and so much texture. The splash of green in the lower right (your plant?) really adds a lot. Best of the raindrops-hitting-water shots in the challenge.', '2006-10-03 23:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893109, 402096, 24970, '<td valign="top">This picture feels so smooth. The colors are excellent, really gives it a dark, gloomy feel. Great capture of the tiny drop and excellent clarity.</td>', 'This picture feels so smooth. The colors are excellent, really gives it a dark, gloomy feel. Great capture of the tiny drop and excellent clarity.', '2006-10-03 23:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893114, 401308, 24970, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge. I love the colors and the placement of your subject. At first I wasn''t sure if I wanted to see more of the face but after looking at it several times I think this is perfect. Good job.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge. I love the colors and the placement of your subject. At first I wasn''t sure if I wanted to see more of the face but after looking at it several times I think this is perfect. Good job.', '2006-10-03 23:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893119, 401478, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very powerful picture indeed. The lack of bright colors give it an old feel which works very well. I could see this framed on somebody''s wall.</td>', 'Very powerful picture indeed. The lack of bright colors give it an old feel which works very well. I could see this framed on somebody''s wall.', '2006-10-03 23:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893126, 402082, 24970, '<td valign="top">The stem in the background really adds a lot to this picture...interest and a sense of structure. Nicely done.</td>', 'The stem in the background really adds a lot to this picture...interest and a sense of structure. Nicely done.', '2006-10-03 23:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893136, 402231, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Very moody, and that horse pops like a beacon. Well done!</td>', 'One of my favorites. Very moody, and that horse pops like a beacon. Well done!', '2006-10-03 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893153, 401039, 24970, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea and composition. The tarp has a strange color quality to it and I wish something (probably the water) was really in sharp focus. However, I can see where you were going with this and with a different camera I think this would do really well. Good eye for creating an interesting shot.</td>', 'I really like your idea and composition. The tarp has a strange color quality to it and I wish something (probably the water) was really in sharp focus. However, I can see where you were going with this and with a different camera I think this would do really well. Good eye for creating an interesting shot.', '2006-10-03 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2893155, 402161, 17203, '<td valign="top">I tend to avoid centered compositions, but the detail and sharpness are incredible in this one. Great job!</td>', 'I tend to avoid centered compositions, but the detail and sharpness are incredible in this one. Great job!', '2006-10-03 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
