(2894270, 402161, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Wish I''d used a couple I had like it.  They still wouldn''t have held up to yours.  I''m assuming you used flash.<br/>Didn''t vote because I didn''t enter, but it would have been an instantaneous 10 when I saw it.  Got tickled at the spray bottle comments below, hoppers usually won''t hold still for that.  As for centered composition, I thought the eye was pretty close to being on a third.  :)   You know you have a good macro shot when it scores a blue ribbon even with the creep out vote.  Go ahead and buy that 105 VR Macro lens  now.  You deserve it.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Wish I''d used a couple I had like it.  They still wouldn''t have held up to yours.  I''m assuming you used flash.Didn''t vote because I didn''t enter, but it would have been an instantaneous 10 when I saw it.  Got tickled at the spray bottle comments below, hoppers usually won''t hold still for that.  As for centered composition, I thought the eye was pretty close to being on a third.  :)   You know you have a good macro shot when it scores a blue ribbon even with the creep out vote.  Go ahead and buy that 105 VR Macro lens  now.  You deserve it.', '2006-10-04 03:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
