(2895123, 401644, 50695, '<td valign="top">sheesh, your highest scoring photo and I gave you a 6, which is one of the lowest scores I''ve given you. 6 isn''t a bad score, mind you, it''s the same I gave the ribbon winners. Looking at it again, I can see that it fulfills the challenge splendidly: it''s soooo wet and rainy. It just didn''t grab me while I was voting. uh-oh... maybe I''m becoming a focus nazi! :O</td>', 'sheesh, your highest scoring photo and I gave you a 6, which is one of the lowest scores I''ve given you. 6 isn''t a bad score, mind you, it''s the same I gave the ribbon winners. Looking at it again, I can see that it fulfills the challenge splendidly: it''s soooo wet and rainy. It just didn''t grab me while I was voting. uh-oh... maybe I''m becoming a focus nazi! :O', '2006-10-04 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 0),
