(2895435, 400127, 24454, '<td valign="top">Such gorgeous "Ursula" work!   Photos like "Ursula" have come to be the highest compliment anyone could get  :)   And this one is certainly true that that beautiful style!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Such gorgeous "Ursula" work!   Photos like "Ursula" have come to be the highest compliment anyone could get  :)   And this one is certainly true that that beautiful style! ', '2006-10-04 11:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
