(2897936, 402252, 7756, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I wonder why 21 people (6%) voted this 4 or below? Would be good if the top 5% and bottom 5% were discarded when working out averages. Anyway congratulations on the 2nd place.<br/> <br/>Edit<br/>I worked out average scores removing the top and bottom 5% and then 10% and the score only rose by less than 0.1 in both cases so I guess the low scorers are balanced out by the high scorers!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-04 22:06:09.</i></td>', 'Great shot. I wonder why 21 people (6%) voted this 4 or below? Would be good if the top 5% and bottom 5% were discarded when working out averages. Anyway congratulations on the 2nd place. EditI worked out average scores removing the top and bottom 5% and then 10% and the score only rose by less than 0.1 in both cases so I guess the low scorers are balanced out by the high scorers!', '2006-10-04 22:56:10.000000', '2006-10-04 23:06:09.000000', 0),
