(2908327, 402109, 55838, '<td valign="top">Another great shot with an excellent score.  Pleasantly clean &amp; simple and I like the story!  I voted it 7.</td>', 'Another great shot with an excellent score.  Pleasantly clean & simple and I like the story!  I voted it 7.', '2006-10-08 15:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
